<ScenContainer xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <ScenTitle>Snoopy, 1969</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;B&gt;Date:&lt;/B&gt; 28 May 1969 &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Location:&lt;/B&gt; Barents Sea &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Playable Side:&lt;/B&gt; United States &lt;BR&gt;&lt;B&gt;Duration:&lt;/B&gt; 2 days &lt;BR&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Intelligence reports indicate that the Soviet Air Defence Force (PVO) is testing a new fire control radar in a major air defence exercise centred around the Kola Peninsula. The Office of Naval Intelligence and National Security Agency are keen to analyse the electromagnetic emissions of this new radar in order to develop countermeasures.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;While returning from their North Pole deployment, &lt;I&gt;SSN 638 Whale&lt;/I&gt; is tasked with covertly recording the emissions from coastal air defences along the Soviet coastline.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
